* SPICE Netlist for the Given Schematic

VGG 2 4 DC <VG_VALUE>
VDD 6 0 DC <VDD_VALUE>

RS 1 2 <RS_VALUE>
Ci 2 4 <Ci_VALUE>
CC 2 5 <CC_VALUE>
RD 2 6 <RD_VALUE>
RL 5 3 <RL_VALUE>

M1 2 4 0 0 NMOS

* VGG is the gate voltage source
* VDD is the drain supply voltage
* Note: Ground is node 0

.END